    <briefdescription>
<para>Polynomial-2 cutoff function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><formula id="4">\[ f_c(r) = \begin{equation} \begin{cases} 1 &amp; \text{if } r \leq (r_c-1)\\ r^3(r(15-6r)-10)+1 &amp; \text{if } (r_c-1) &lt; r \leq r_c\\ 0 &amp; \text{otherwise}\\ \end{cases} \end{equation} \]</formula></para>
<para>Singraber, A., Rg Behler, J., Dellago, C. (2019). Library-Based LAMMPS Implementation of High-Dimensional Neural Network Potentials. <ulink url="https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.8b00770">https://doi.org/10.1021/acs.jctc.8b00770</ulink> </para>
    </detaileddescription>
